---
const title = 'Jumpstart Scaling - Break Through The 7-Figure Ceiling';
const description = 'The proven methodology that helped 500+ founders automate operations, reclaim 20 hours a week, and build a valuation-ready asset in 90 days.';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description}>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        :root {
            --primary: #FF6B35;
            --primary-dark: #E85A2A;
            --secondary: #4ECDC4;
            --dark: #0a0a0a;
            --dark-2: #1a1a1a;
            --dark-3: #2a2a2a;
            --text: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #a0a0a0;
            --accent: #FFD93D;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
        
        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #1a1a2e 100%);
        }
        .hero::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; } 50% { opacity: 0.8; } }
        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            color: white; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 2rem;
            animation: slideDown 0.6s ease-out;
        }
        @keyframes slideDown { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; position: relative; z-index: 1;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.2s both;
        }
        .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem); color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 3rem; max-width: 800px;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.4s both;
        }
        @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
        .cta-primary {
            display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
            color: white; padding: 1.25rem 3rem; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.3);
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.6s both; border: none; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .cta-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.5); }
        .cta-subtext {
            display: block; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.8s both;
        }

        /* Letter Section */
        .letter { background: var(--dark-2); padding: 6rem 0; position: relative; }
        .letter-content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
        .letter-content h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--primary); }
        .letter-content p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #d0d0d0; }
        .letter-content strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }

        /* Pillars Section */
        .pillars { padding: 6rem 0; background: var(--dark); }
        .section-title { text-align: center; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .section-subtitle { text-align: center; font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 4rem; }
        .pillars-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
        .pillar-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-2) 0%, var(--dark-3) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2); border-radius: 20px; padding: 3rem;
            transition: all 0.4s ease; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .pillar-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2); }
        .pillar-number { font-size: 4rem; font-weight: 900; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .pillar-card h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: white; }
        .pillar-card p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .pillar-outcome { background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); margin-top: 1.5rem; }

        /* Services Section */
        .services { padding: 6rem 0; background: var(--dark-2); }
        .service-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
        .service-card {
            background: var(--dark-3); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 2rem; transition: all 0.3s ease; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
        }
        .service-card:hover { border-color: var(--secondary); transform: translateY(-5px); background: #222; }
        .service-title { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: white; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; min-height: 3rem; }
        .service-price { color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .service-desc { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .service-list { list-style: none; margin-top: auto; }
        .service-list li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #d0d0d0; font-size: 0.9rem; display: flex; align-items: start; }
        .service-list li:before { content: "✔"; color: var(--secondary); margin-right: 8px; }

        /* Testimonials */
        .testimonials { background: var(--dark); padding: 6rem 0; }
        .testimonial-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
        .testimonial { background: var(--dark-3); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(78, 205, 196, 0.2); transition: all 0.3s ease; }
        .testimonial:hover { border-color: var(--secondary); transform: translateY(-5px); }
        .testimonial-text { font-size: 1.1rem; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #d0d0d0; }
        .testimonial-author { font-weight: 700; color: var(--secondary); }

        /* Survey */
        .survey { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark) 0%, var(--dark-2) 100%); padding: 6rem 0; }
        .form-container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--dark-2); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.3); }
        .form-step { display: none; }
        .form-step.active { display: block; animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .form-group label { display: block; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .form-group input, .form-group select, .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%; padding: 1rem; background: var(--dark-3); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px; color: white; font-size: 1rem; font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .form-group input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1); }
        .radio-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
        .radio-option {
            background: var(--dark-3); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
        }
        .radio-option:hover { border-color: var(--primary); background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.05); }
        .radio-option input[type="radio"], .radio-option input[type="checkbox"] { width: auto; accent-color: var(--primary); }
        .form-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
        .btn { padding: 1rem 2rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s ease; flex: 1; }
        .btn-next { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark)); color: white; }
        .btn-next:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.3); }
        .btn-prev { background: var(--dark-3); color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }
        .btn-prev:hover { background: var(--dark); }
        .progress-bar { height: 4px; background: var(--dark-3); border-radius: 2px; margin-bottom: 2rem; overflow: hidden; }
        .progress-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary)); transition: width 0.3s ease; }
        .success-message { display: none; text-align: center; padding: 3rem; }
        .success-message.active { display: block; animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out; }
        
        /* Footer */
        footer { background: var(--dark); padding: 3rem 0; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }
        .trust-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .badge { padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; background: var(--dark-2); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .pillars-grid, .testimonial-grid, .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .form-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
            h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <span class="eyebrow">ATTENTION: FOUNDERS, CEOS, AND AGENCY OWNERS</span>
            <h1>THE <span class="highlight">"SCALING TRAP"</span>: Why Working Harder Is Actually Shrinking Your Margins</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Discover the "Jumpstart Scaling" Methodology that has helped 500+ founders automate operations.</p>
            <a href="#survey" class="cta-primary">YES! SEND ME THE JUMPSTART BLUEPRINT NOW</a>
            <span class="cta-subtext">100% Free Access | No Credit Card Required</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="letter">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="letter-content">
                <h2>DEAR FELLOW FOUNDER,</h2>
                <p>If you're reading this page, you're likely in the "Golden Handcuffs" phase or the "Plateau of Death". What got you to $1M will kill you at $5M.</p>
                <p>You don't have a "lead generation" problem. You have a <strong>SCALING problem</strong>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
