                    <p>Stop relying on "referrals". Install an automated system to bring in leads like clockwork.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-number">02</div>
                    <h3>THE DELIVERY SYSTEM</h3>
                    <p>Extract your genius into a playbook your team can execute without you.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pillar-card">
                    <div class="pillar-number">03</div>
                    <h3>THE TEAM OS</h3>
                    <p>Install KPIs and accountability. Create a team that brings you solutions, not problems.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">OUR SERVICES & PRICING</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to scale, done for you</p>
            
            <div class="service-grid">
                <!-- Paid Ads -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-title">Ad Spend Pack ($0-5k)</div>
                    <div class="service-price">$2,250/mo</div>
                    <div class="service-desc">Expert ad management for early-stage scaling.</div>
                    <ul class="service-list">
                        <li>Daily Optimization</li><li>ROI Reports</li><li>Creative Refreshes</li><li>Dedicated Manager</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-title">Ad Spend Pack ($5k-15k)</div>
                    <div class="service-price">$4,500/mo</div>
                    <div class="service-desc">Advanced management for growing budgets.</div>
                    <ul class="service-list">
                        <li>Advanced Targeting</li><li>Multi-Platform Ads</li><li>Weekly Analytics</li><li>Custom Strategies</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-title">Ad Spend Pack ($15k-50k)</div>
                    <div class="service-price">$5,500/mo</div>
                    <div class="service-desc">Aggressive scaling for significant spend.</div>
                    <ul class="service-list">
                        <li>Daily Management</li><li>Funnel Optimization</li><li>VIP Support</li><li>Attribution Analytics</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-title">Ad Spend Pack ($50k+)</div>
                    <div class="service-price">$9,500/mo</div>
                    <div class="service-desc">Elite, high-touch management.</div>
                    <ul class="service-list">
                        <li>Market Domination</li><li>Real-Time Optimization</li><li>24/7 Priority Support</li><li>White-Glove Service</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Funnels & Dev -->
                <div class="service-card">
                    <div class="service-title">Sales Funnel Creation</div>
                    <div class="service-price">$3,500/project</div>
                    <div class="service-desc">Custom, conversion-driven funnels.</div>
                    <ul class="service-list">
                        <li>Custom Design</li><li>A/B Testing</li><li>Copywriting</li><li>Tech Integration</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
